key   close_res_tl_type                            int   -  "TL field of SML_PublicClose.Res: the data type (0 octet string, 4 boolean, 5 integer, 6 unsigned, 7 list)"
key   crc16                                        int   -  "crc16 of the message (not checked) (unsigned integer)"
key   crc16_tl_len                                 int   -  "TL field of crc16 of the message (not checked): the length in bytes, the TL byte included"
key   crc16_tl_more                                int   -  "TL field of crc16 of the message (not checked): 1 when a further TL byte follows (not carried beyond this bit)"
key   crc16_tl_type                                int   -  "TL field of crc16 of the message (not checked): the data type (0 octet string, 4 boolean, 5 integer, 6 unsigned, 7 list)"
key   entry_count                                  int   -  "number of elements of the list a list entry"
